  "sale_events": [],
  "body": "Set back from the road in one of Devonport's most sought-after pockets, this charming two-bedroom unit puts you right in the heart of everything. It is a short stroll along the waterfront to the Devonport ferry, so the commute into the city is a breeze, and the village shops, cafes, restaurants and scenic walks are all just minutes away on foot. Pull up a map and you will see how well placed it is.\r\n\r\nFreshly redecorated and move-in ready, the 60m² home feels calm, bright and comfortable from the moment you step inside, newly painted and fitted with brand new carpet. Good indoor-outdoor flow leads to garden areas at both the front and rear, with plenty of sunny space to sit out, unwind and enjoy an afternoon glass of wine.\r\n\r\nThere is a dedicated car space, and the unit sits within a quiet, well looked after complex, making this an easy lock-up-and-leave. For investors there is a real bonus too, with the unit Healthy Homes compliant, a tidy and low-maintenance addition in a blue-chip location that holds its appeal. Move in and enjoy as is, or add your own personal touch over time.\r\n\r\nWhether you are a first-home buyer, downsizer, couple, retiree or savvy investor, this is a genuine opportunity to secure a slice of peaceful Devonport living. Bright, fresh and perfectly placed, opportunities like this do not last long.\r\n\r\nCall anytime to arrange a viewing.",
